### AI-Generated Synthesis

ScholarFlux MCP uses AI models to synthesize retrieved records into research summaries.
When using the synthesis features, you must additionally:

- ✅ Treat AI-generated summaries as starting points for research, not authoritative conclusions
- ✅ Verify cited findings against the original source records before publication or clinical use
- ✅ Disclose AI involvement in any research outputs that incorporate generated syntheses
- ✅ Apply professional judgment — AI synthesis is a research aid, not a substitute for expert review

